    "format-version": "0.1",
    "license": "MIT",
    "name": "Genomic Assembly and analysis - RDH version 6",
    "report": {
        "markdown": "# Job Overview\n\n```galaxy\nworkflow_display()\n```\n\n# Quality Control (QC)\n# QC - CheckM\n## QC Contamination, Completeness and Depth Report\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"checkm_depth_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n# QC - Quast\n## QC Assembly Report\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"quast_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Taxonomic Species ID's Report\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"bracken_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Multilocus Sequence Typing\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"mlst_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Salmonella Serovar Calling (SISTR)\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"sistr_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Shigella Serotyping (ShigaPass)\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"shigapass_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Streptococcus Pyogenes (IGAS) Emmtyping (Emmtyper)\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"emmtyper_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Corynebacterium diphtheriae Typing (Toxin & MLST)\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"cdiphtheriae_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR) abriTAMR\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"abritamr_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR) abriTAMR Virulence tox (CDIP)\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"virulence_summary\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Antimicrobial Resistance (AMR) ABRicate\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"abricate_output\", show_column_headers=true)\n```\n\n## Genomic assemblies\n1. Switch to the new workflow history by selecting the History Switcher (arrow icon) in the upper-right corner and choosing the required history.\n2. In the history panel, locate and select the Assemblies dataset collection.\n3. Select Download and wait for the download to begin.\n"
    },
